"# replay-parity: FAIL (run 01M52Z67EP0000000000000099)

- Recording: \`recording.jsonl\` (4 exchanges, 4 selected)
- Target: \`http://localhost:3001\` via http
- Pacing: as-recorded, concurrency 4, requested n/a, achieved 10.0 rps, schedule slip p50 1.00 ms, max 3.00 ms
- Duration: 300 ms, warmup 0, filter none, limit none

## Thresholds

| Outcome | Row | Limit | Measured | Detail |
| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | --- |
| pass | \`latency.overall.p99_ms\` | 100 | 25.007 |  |
| fail | \`latency.by_tag.get-items.p50_ms\` | 5 | 12.007 |  |
| fail | \`correctness.mismatch_rate_max\` | 0 | 0.5 |  |
| pass | \`errors.rate_max\` | 0.5 | 0.3333 |  |
| pass | \`pacing.slip_max_ms\` | 250 | 3 |  |

## Latency

Reference / candidate in milliseconds. Reference values come from the recording.

| Tag | Count | Errors | p50 | p99 | max |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| overall | 3 | 1 | 10.0 / 12.0 | 20.0 / 25.0 | 20.0 / 25.0 |
| create-item | 1 | 0 | 20.0 / 25.0 | 20.0 / 25.0 | 20.0 / 25.0 |
| get-items | 2 | 1 | 10.0 / 12.0 | 10.0 / 12.0 | 10.0 / 12.0 |

## Correctness

2 compared, 1 match, 0 tolerated, 1 mismatch (50.00%), 1 errors (33.33%).

Top mismatching paths. Array positions are folded into \`[*]\`, so rows that moved count as one path.

| Path | Findings | Exchanges |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| \`$.total\` | 1 | 1 |

## Invariants

Each system is checked against its own recording. Agreement between the two systems is not evidence of correctness.

- reference: 3 hold
- candidate: 1 hold, 1 violated, 1 inconclusive
  - 1. \`shipment-applied-once\` violated (2 checks): order o-7: expected 2, observed 4. shp-3 delivered 2 times
  - 10. \`allocation-deterministic\` inconclusive (1 check): no stock read fixes a baseline

## Reproduction

**reduced reproduction** for rule \`invariant:candidate:shipment-applied-once\`: 283 recorded steps reduced to 4 in 13 attempts (34.0 ms), written to \`reduced-reproduction.jsonl\`.

| # | Request | Tags | Body |
| ---: | --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | POST /v1/orders | create-order | \`{"sku":"H-800","qty":2}\` (quantity reduced) |
| 2 | GET /v1/orders/o-12 | get-order |  |

## Agent

claude-sonnet-5-5: 1 of 2 rounds, 4 cases proposed, 4 valid, 4 executed, 1 kept. Stopped on \`max_rounds\`. Cost $0.30 of a $2.00 budget (1000 input tokens, 200 output tokens, 0 read from cache).

| Case | Round | Hypothesis | Tags | Status ref / cand | Revealed |
| --- | ---: | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| \`case-1\` | 1 | odd quantities round differently | create-item | 201 / 201 | $.total differs by half a cent |
"
`;

